I would like to automate testing UI interactions to avoid regressions when changing core components like the document widget. The following adds shortcuts to record and playback a macro, which contains keystrokes, assertions and breakpoints. There'll be more documentation and an example of using this in the Zathura PR. This could also form the basis for a macro system in Zathura similar to Vim macros.

Something I found while testing was in `simulate_key_press` from the feedkeys shortcut, gtk wouldn't always finish "processing" an event (e.g. more events remaining) before starting the next one leading to improper behaviour. Using 
```c
do {
    g_main_context_iteration(NULL, FALSE);
  } while (g_main_context_pending(NULL));
```
instead of `gtk_main_iteration_do(FALSE)` seems to help this, since it'll wait until there are not more events before moving on to the next key event.

Implements 4 advanced visual features: custom animated cursor, theme toggle transition, project carousel, and interactive timeline.

## Implementation

### Custom Cursor
- Dual-element cursor system (dot + follower) using `requestAnimationFrame` with idle detection
- Hover states for interactive elements, preserves I-beam for text inputs
- Respects `prefers-reduced-motion`, hidden on mobile

```javascript
// Optimized follower animation with exit condition
function animateFollower() {
  const dx = cursorX - followerX;
  const dy = cursorY - followerY;

  if (Math.abs(dx) > 0.5 || Math.abs(dy) > 0.5) {
    followerX += dx * 0.1;
    followerY += dy * 0.1;
    cursorFollower.style.left = followerX + 'px';
    cursorFollower.style.top = followerY + 'px';
    animationId = requestAnimationFrame(animateFollower);
  } else {
    animationId = null; // Stop when idle
  }
}
```

### Theme Toggle Animation
- Sun/moon icon rotation + scale transition with CSS cubic-bezier
- Full-page overlay sweep effect (0.6s, scales from bottom→top)
- Theme switch occurs mid-animation at 300ms

### Project Carousel
- Single-project view with prev/next buttons, dot navigation
- 5s auto-play with proper interval cleanup
- ARIA labels for screen readers

### Timeline
- Gradient-connected vertical timeline with year badges
- IntersectionObserver-triggered fade-in animations (0.6s)
- Zigzag layout on desktop, linear on mobile

